id: pm-hmpu4p
title: Close lifecycle bypasses reproducible process clock
description: "The exact transport-parity gate for agent transcripts exposed that SDK closeItem stamps closed_at and default completed_at from the wall clock instead of the PM_CLOCK reproducible process contract, so independent equivalent workspaces diverge byte-for-byte."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:sdk",determinism,lifecycle,recursive-self-improvement,review-feedback
created_at: "2026-08-28T12:28:49.337Z"
