comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-28T12:28:49.337Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: all-status exact-phrase searches for reproducible clock and reproducible process returned zero canonical items; closed_at search found pm-m4iu for stamping presence and pm-wrbe for historical backfill, neither owns deterministic runtime clock consumption. The transcript parity gate on pm-8pnj discovered this distinct recurrence."
  "2026-08-28T12:30:46.740Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: the process-level reproducibility suite failed on closed_at and completed_at. Expected the seeded PM_CLOCK instant 2026-08-22T12:00:00.000Z; SDK closeItem emitted the live wall clock while created_at and updated_at remained deterministic. Command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/integration/reproducible-process.integration.spec.ts."
  "2026-08-28T12:35:58.471Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: SDK closeItem now calls the shared nowIso contract. Independent seeded CLI processes close equivalent items with identical authoritative snapshots; closed_at and default completed_at remain equal and within the declared PM_CLOCK sequence. The focused process suite passes 3/3, and the real five-task transcript replay now passes exact payload parity at 4,331 estimated tokens."
  "2026-08-28T12:52:17.317Z","harness:codex","Final assurance: focused independent-process regression passes 3/3; connected real transcript replay passes five tasks at 4,331 tokens; repository-wide coverage on parent pm-8pnj passes exact 100/100/100/100 including this lifecycle source and negative control."
  "2026-08-28T13:08:21.400Z","harness:codex","Graph correction evidence: repository graph-composition measured one new prose-edge gap because the duplicate-check comment cites historical backfill owner pm-wrbe. Added the missing relationship while retaining typed discovered_from and verifies edges to the implementation lineage."
